msgstr "Les plugins requis sont manquants."

#: includes/admin/views/overview.php:80
msgid ""
"BuddyPress Job Manager needs both BuddyPress and WP Job Manager to be "
"active. Activate them to use the profile job and resume features."
msgstr ""
"BuddyPress Job Manager a besoin que BuddyPress et WP Job Manager soient tous "
"deux actifs. Active-les pour utiliser les fonctionnalités de profil d'emploi "
"et de CV."

